## Development

The toolchain is pinned with [devenv](https://devenv.sh) (Nix): Python {{ python_version }}, uv, ruff, mypy{% if include_terraform %}, Terraform, TFLint, Trivy{% endif %}{% if include_docker %}, hadolint{% endif %}, gitleaks and the git hooks.

```bash
devenv shell      # or just `cd` into the folder with direnv installed
lint              # ruff + mypy
tests             # pytest
devenv test       # what CI runs
```

Without Nix:

```bash
uv sync
uv run pytest
```

